roles: desk=c1 eng=c2 ship=c3
title: Support | one ticket, team by team
matrix: Who holds a ticket | three teams, four stages
column in: Intake | arrives
column tr: Triage | sorted
column fx: Fix | worked on
column cl: Close | confirmed
desk d: Front desk | first contact
  in: [t1] New ticket | by email; [t2] Chat ask | live chat; + urgent
  tr: [t3] Tag it | priority and owner
  cl: [t6] Reply sent | the customer is told
eng e: Engineering | owns the fix
  tr: + needs a repro
  fx: [t4] Patch | with a test; + hotfix; ... about 40 more in the queue
ship s: Release | ships the change
  fx: [t5] Review | two approvals
  cl: + deployed
@step Arrive: A ticket arrives at the front desk.
light d.in: two tickets wait
light t1
@step Triage: The desk tags it and passes it on.
light d.tr
light e.tr: a repro is asked for
@step Fix: Engineering patches it.
show t4
light e.fx
@step Close: The desk tells the customer.
show t6
light *.cl
